WEBVTT

00:14.980 --> 00:16.970
One day during the
second World War,...

00:17.540 --> 00:20.510
I stopped by at a
pet shop in Chinatown.

00:22.950 --> 00:32.120
A young Chinese man sold me
a legendary beast called a...Kirin.

00:35.460 --> 00:36.900
He told me...

00:37.630 --> 00:44.040
The holy beast, Kirin, serves
no one but a sovereign.

00:44.640 --> 00:47.800
That is to say, the one who captures
the Kirin also obtains the fate...

00:47.840 --> 00:49.640
to become a ruler.

00:50.810 --> 00:55.510
What he said was true.
I became a sovereign.

00:57.050 --> 00:59.650
The President of the United States!

01:04.420 --> 01:07.920
Is this true? If it is...

01:10.360 --> 01:12.590
...our dream will come true!

01:19.910 --> 01:21.270
Please leave!!

01:21.940 --> 01:25.140
No matter how much you offer,
I cannot sell you what I don't have.

01:25.650 --> 01:29.010
They say you can get anything here!

01:29.820 --> 01:31.150
Please leave now.

01:31.220 --> 01:32.450
Hey, come on!

01:32.490 --> 01:33.850
What's going on?

01:34.190 --> 01:35.380
Oh, Mr. Detective.

01:35.660 --> 01:36.640
A detective!?

01:38.060 --> 01:39.080
You are...

01:39.160 --> 01:41.130
We should get going, Roger.

01:41.660 --> 01:42.650
Alright.

01:44.830 --> 01:48.430
That was Roger T. Stanford,
the Congressman.

01:49.870 --> 01:51.360
He was?
He seemed so young...

01:53.170 --> 01:56.440
He became the youngest Congressman
in history two years ago.

01:56.880 --> 01:59.370
He comes from a distinguished family,
which has produced well-known...

01:59.410 --> 02:01.210
politicians for generations.

02:01.350 --> 02:04.220
Then he's a thoroughbred
in the political world.

02:05.790 --> 02:09.190
Though he is said to be the
bad apple of the family.

02:09.820 --> 02:14.920
They say he won't make it
in the next election.

02:15.600 --> 02:17.930
I see. That's why he was here.

02:20.130 --> 02:24.130
Ridiculous! You just read it in my
great grandpa's diary, right?

02:24.710 --> 02:27.610
Did you have to take me
all the way to Chinatown...

02:27.640 --> 02:29.200
for such a pipe dream, Kelly?

02:29.810 --> 02:32.300
I'd believe anything to help
you win the next election.

02:32.650 --> 02:35.480
Roger, we really are in trouble.

02:38.420 --> 02:40.940
I have to go.
I've got a date.

02:41.320 --> 02:43.720
Roger, we still have things to do!

02:43.890 --> 02:45.880
I'll leave it to you.
See you!

02:46.060 --> 02:47.420
Hey, Roger!

02:51.930 --> 02:53.060
Roger.

02:54.470 --> 02:55.760
Na, Nancy...

02:55.840 --> 02:57.830
Kelly, are you alone?

02:58.670 --> 03:02.570
Ah, well, Roger is in an
important meeting and...

03:04.980 --> 03:07.280
An important meeting
with a dancer from Vegas,...

03:07.310 --> 03:09.040
or is it an actress from Hollywood?

03:09.350 --> 03:11.440
Well...

03:14.250 --> 03:17.780
You two haven't changed at all
since your school days.

03:18.760 --> 03:21.120
I'm good for nothing else.

03:22.200 --> 03:25.600
Besides, his family
helped me with school.

03:27.500 --> 03:30.440
Roger is only using you.

03:30.570 --> 03:31.800
That's not true.

03:31.940 --> 03:33.930
He's not a bad person at heart.

03:34.810 --> 03:37.240
Besides, how can I put it...

03:38.180 --> 03:43.980
he's so likable, don't you think?
He is charismatic.

03:46.120 --> 03:49.450
I guess I'm one of those who
was deluded by that charisma.

03:50.090 --> 03:51.020
What?

03:51.760 --> 03:55.960
I got married to him mistaking his
assertiveness and conceit...

03:56.000 --> 03:57.520
for manliness.

03:58.800 --> 04:03.240
But he only needed
my family's wealth.

04:04.300 --> 04:06.070
Don't say that, Nancy.

04:06.610 --> 04:12.880
I finally realized the true value of
a man is tenderness and sincerity.

04:15.180 --> 04:18.450
It's not too late,
I want to start over.

04:18.550 --> 04:19.680
Nancy!

04:23.160 --> 04:25.150
No, Nancy, you have to...

04:26.230 --> 04:28.960
You are going to be
the future First Lady.

04:30.730 --> 04:34.030
It's no use coming here again,
I cannot sell what I don't have.

04:34.470 --> 04:35.200
No.

04:36.170 --> 04:40.830
I'm here to get a pet
to comfort a lady.

04:41.780 --> 04:43.070
Come in, Nancy.

04:48.350 --> 04:51.980
This is Nancy Grayson,
the wife of Roger Stanford.

04:54.720 --> 04:56.550
Ah, I'm not really...

04:59.190 --> 05:01.250
This woman has an aura of...

05:06.000 --> 05:07.060
Wh...what?

05:07.730 --> 05:08.860
What's wrong?

05:21.450 --> 05:23.250
What, what was that?

05:24.990 --> 05:28.550
Their king has descended.

05:29.490 --> 05:30.680
What?

05:31.930 --> 05:33.920
My name is Count D.

05:34.030 --> 05:36.790
Pleased to make your acquaintance,
your Highness.

05:43.140 --> 05:44.160
What?

05:44.370 --> 05:47.530
You will sell us the Kirin?

05:47.870 --> 05:50.400
Yes, though with great
reluctance on my part.

05:50.910 --> 05:56.210
Please come again tomorrow
afternoon with your friend, Roger.

05:57.450 --> 05:59.440
We are going to get a Kirin!

06:00.250 --> 06:01.850
That man is strange.

06:02.920 --> 06:05.980
Why did he call me "Your Highness"?

06:06.590 --> 06:10.820
He predicted you will become
the wife of a ruler.

06:15.140 --> 06:17.030
Kelly, I still want to...

06:17.170 --> 06:18.430
No, Nancy!

06:19.840 --> 06:25.010
I'm sorry. But you are going
to be the future First Lady.

06:26.210 --> 06:27.770
It's a dream.

06:28.450 --> 06:30.940
No, it's not.
I'm serious.

06:33.490 --> 06:36.010
My father was
killed in Vietnam.

06:37.220 --> 06:40.560
My mother couldn't cope with
the reality and escaped to alcohol.

06:41.830 --> 06:44.160
The pension was as good as nothing.

06:44.230 --> 06:46.930
Even our house was
about to be taken away.

06:50.800 --> 06:54.070
We were on the verge
of becoming homeless.

07:04.850 --> 07:08.980
Kelly Vincent, you have been
selected as the recipient of...

07:09.060 --> 07:12.290
the 60th Stanford Foundation
Special Scholarship.

07:17.030 --> 07:19.620
Roger seemed like a prince.

07:20.770 --> 07:25.300
Yes, Roger has the
power of the sun.

07:26.770 --> 07:29.500
With his power, it may be possible
to realize a world without...

07:29.540 --> 07:33.270
starvation,
poverty or even war.

07:33.780 --> 07:34.610
Kelly...

07:35.280 --> 07:41.910
I'm the one who's using Roger.
Tenderness and sincerity are...

07:42.790 --> 07:45.020
not enough to make
a good politician.

07:45.220 --> 07:49.820
You have to have money, power
and the charisma Roger has.

07:50.630 --> 07:53.760
My role is to procure for him
that which he doesn't have.

07:53.970 --> 07:56.160
Even if I have to
get my hands dirty.

07:57.100 --> 07:59.090
I will make Roger the President!

07:59.140 --> 08:02.870
And I will make you the
First Lady of the White House!

08:04.380 --> 08:13.680
I don't want to be the First Lady.
All I want is a small, happy family...

08:15.160 --> 08:19.720
a family with children,
birds and a dog.

08:20.260 --> 08:22.390
All of us will gather
for dinner every night.

08:22.930 --> 08:26.590
A family is all I want.

08:27.900 --> 08:28.890
Nancy...

08:32.170 --> 08:35.570
Thank you for taking
your time to come by.

08:36.140 --> 08:37.200
Please.

08:40.280 --> 08:45.680
So, you are going to sell it.
After all, you are a businessman.

08:46.690 --> 08:49.880
No, it is the Kirin's wish.

08:50.690 --> 08:52.380
The Kirin's wish?

08:53.490 --> 08:56.460
In Asia, Kirin is considered
one of the four holy beasts...

08:56.500 --> 08:59.660
along with dragon,
phoenix and tortoise.

09:00.400 --> 09:02.390
It is thought to have the furs
of all animals on the earth...

09:02.430 --> 09:04.490
and is referred to as
the king of the animals.

09:12.580 --> 09:16.040
Thank you for your patience.
I have brought your master.

09:26.260 --> 09:30.630
It's a human.
Just a kid!

09:31.700 --> 09:33.820
All the male Kirins have the
word "Ki" in their names,...

09:33.870 --> 09:35.860
and all the female have "lin".

09:35.970 --> 09:38.530
Her name is Keilin.

09:39.970 --> 09:46.070
As you asked, here's the Kirin.
The king of all animals.

09:48.250 --> 09:54.190
I see. Your business is to
sell children, calling them pets!

09:54.550 --> 09:55.420
Roger...

09:55.520 --> 09:57.580
I'm afraid that's not what I need.

09:58.420 --> 10:03.790
I suggest you get out of this city
before you get caught by the police.

10:04.200 --> 10:05.430
Let's go, Kelly!

10:05.600 --> 10:08.260
Please wait, Mr. President.

10:10.340 --> 10:11.390
What?

10:12.340 --> 10:17.040
Your being re-elected to the House
of Representatives is merely a start.

10:17.880 --> 10:22.180
From there, you will become Senator,
then Governor, and finally...

10:22.280 --> 10:25.580
the youngest President in history.

10:26.390 --> 10:30.720
All the nations will throw
themselves at your feet.

10:31.690 --> 10:38.600
You can prove you are not
the bad apple of the family.

10:39.570 --> 10:45.270
A world without poverty
and war will be possible.

10:46.570 --> 10:51.370
The Kirin has the power
to realize your ambitions.

10:53.750 --> 10:59.410
The payment can be made
when you become President.

11:01.620 --> 11:03.610
I will see you again soon.

11:04.460 --> 11:08.320
Only two Presidential
elections from now.

11:30.820 --> 11:35.950
How many rulers in history
have made contracts with a Kirin?

11:37.290 --> 11:40.660
A communist who tried
to free his country from...

11:40.960 --> 11:44.090
colonial reign by waging war
and losing half his land...

11:44.130 --> 11:45.930
and one third of his people.

11:47.200 --> 11:50.930
A nationalist who tried to save
his defeated nation from poverty...

11:51.470 --> 11:54.500
and ended up massacring
millions of other people.

11:56.780 --> 12:00.510
And, a President, wishing to end a war,
pressed the switch to detonate...

12:00.550 --> 12:05.950
a new weapon, turning the
world into a living hell.

12:08.550 --> 12:13.620
A human cannot capture a Kirin.
The Kirin chooses its own master.

12:15.630 --> 12:20.360
It will grant the ruler's wish
with blood shed from others.

12:23.700 --> 12:28.200
Which one of the two men
will be chosen by the Kirin?

12:34.580 --> 12:37.880
How did we end up taking this kid?

12:38.250 --> 12:41.280
Don't worry about it.
We didn't even have to pay.

12:42.460 --> 12:44.320
Besides, it may have
been better this way.

12:44.360 --> 12:46.880
Rather than having her
sold to someone else.

12:47.690 --> 12:50.630
But, this constitutes a breach
of the Child Welfare Law.

12:51.800 --> 12:55.670
If we aren't careful,
this could become a scandal.

13:05.240 --> 13:06.540
What's that bus doing?

13:06.580 --> 13:07.770
What's going on?

13:11.620 --> 13:13.610
Hey, it's going way too fast!

13:14.150 --> 13:16.990
That's a school bus!
What's the driver doing?

13:17.360 --> 13:18.410
Are they in trouble?

13:18.460 --> 13:19.650
Catch up with them!

13:22.900 --> 13:25.460
Hey, what are you doing?
Slow down!!

13:25.970 --> 13:28.960
The accelerator's stuck!

13:29.370 --> 13:30.230
What!!

13:30.340 --> 13:31.530
What about the brakes?

13:31.570 --> 13:33.040
They don't work!!

13:39.280 --> 13:41.640
We should go around to the
other side and press the bus...

13:41.680 --> 13:43.010
against the bluff.

13:43.550 --> 13:45.240
We don't have any other choice!

13:51.290 --> 13:52.810
OK, we'll stop you!

14:01.500 --> 14:02.360
OK.

14:03.370 --> 14:04.960
Almost got it...

14:38.500 --> 14:39.560
Roger...

15:14.840 --> 15:16.830
You are the Kirin.

15:19.480 --> 15:22.070
What is your wish?

15:24.250 --> 15:25.440
My...wish?

15:26.550 --> 15:30.010
Your wish, the greatest
wealth in this world?

15:30.520 --> 15:33.420
Fame? Power?

15:36.260 --> 15:42.890
My wish is...for Roger
to become President and...

15:43.870 --> 15:48.070
create a world
without poverty and war.

15:51.310 --> 15:53.580
No, that's not it.

15:56.650 --> 15:58.640
What I really want is...

16:01.350 --> 16:03.340
Nancy's smile.

16:07.590 --> 16:13.190
That's all I want.

16:16.870 --> 16:18.390
Granted!

16:23.580 --> 16:25.440
My Sovereign...

16:27.180 --> 16:31.380
reach for your fate
with your own hands.

16:33.390 --> 16:35.110
My Sovereign...

16:41.890 --> 16:44.120
Roger T. Stanford had an accident?!

16:46.000 --> 16:47.190
Oh, sorry.

16:47.830 --> 16:50.390
He tried to stop a runaway
school bus and fell right...

16:50.430 --> 16:52.130
over the cliff in his car.

16:52.940 --> 16:56.570
Miraculously, Roger escaped death
but his secretary who was driving...

16:56.610 --> 16:58.200
died instantly.

16:58.510 --> 17:01.210
Count D! It's him again!

17:01.310 --> 17:02.210
Leon.

17:02.310 --> 17:06.650
I know they frequented
his pet shop recently.

17:07.350 --> 17:10.980
The Count must have
sold them something strange again!

17:11.390 --> 17:13.760
There's no hard evidence.

17:14.290 --> 17:18.590
Then, please get me a warrant.
If I can check his store...

17:19.330 --> 17:21.660
Chinatown is like
an extraterritoriality.

17:21.700 --> 17:24.930
You know full well that the Chief
can't sign a warrant without...

17:25.000 --> 17:27.560
If the Chief won't,
I'll get it from the Mayor!

17:28.040 --> 17:28.700
What?

17:28.740 --> 17:30.000
Wait! Hey!!

17:30.980 --> 17:33.270
You can't see him
without an appointment.

17:33.380 --> 17:34.970
Shut up!
Get out of my way!

17:35.680 --> 17:37.670
Mayor!
I need to talk to you!

17:39.050 --> 17:40.020
Mayor!

17:41.590 --> 17:42.750
What is it?

17:44.320 --> 17:46.310
You seem very flustered.

17:46.730 --> 17:50.390
Count D?
What are you doing here?

17:52.360 --> 17:54.730
Thanks for waiting, Count D.

17:55.130 --> 17:56.120
Hi, Miss Pengy.

17:56.170 --> 17:57.530
Nice to see you again.

17:57.640 --> 17:58.690
Mayor...

17:58.900 --> 18:01.700
You can't come in here
without an appointment!

18:02.440 --> 18:04.930
How about lunch?

18:05.180 --> 18:07.940
Thank you for the invitation
but I must take my leave soon.

18:09.480 --> 18:12.310
He is a special customer of ours.

18:14.420 --> 18:15.680
By the way...

18:15.790 --> 18:19.690
I hear Roger T. Stanford
survived the accident.

18:21.260 --> 18:24.020
Now, his seat in
the House is secured.

18:24.900 --> 18:25.730
What?

18:26.630 --> 18:31.800
He's a hero who saved
children by risking his own life.

18:32.200 --> 18:34.760
The entire country
is in his favor now.

18:36.270 --> 18:38.440
Not only to the House
of Representatives,...

18:38.640 --> 18:41.340
he may make it to the Senate
and the Governor of the state.

18:42.650 --> 18:44.080
And then...

18:45.950 --> 18:50.120
Maybe we will have
the President of the United States...

18:50.160 --> 18:52.250
as one of our customers.

18:54.830 --> 18:55.950
Roger...

18:56.330 --> 18:57.490
Roger...

18:57.760 --> 18:59.030
Roger...

18:59.760 --> 19:01.030
Roger...

19:05.240 --> 19:06.970
Na...Nancy...

19:08.010 --> 19:09.170
Roger!!

19:09.470 --> 19:12.000
He's come around.
Get the doctor!

19:13.040 --> 19:16.600
Oh, thank God.
You are OK now, Roger.

19:18.120 --> 19:19.170
Roger?

19:20.090 --> 19:22.950
I'm so grateful you survived.

19:31.500 --> 19:36.370
But Kelly...he didn't...

19:37.900 --> 19:39.740
Kelly? Me?

19:43.240 --> 19:45.230
Kelly's gone.

19:47.350 --> 19:49.680
I...died?

19:57.360 --> 20:01.350
Don't cry for me, Nancy.

20:05.900 --> 20:10.230
This is Roger's wedding band?

20:21.410 --> 20:24.810
Mr. Stanford, there's nothing
for you to worry about.

20:24.850 --> 20:26.440
You'll be fine.

20:26.790 --> 20:29.450
See, there are so
many get-well gifts.

20:29.490 --> 20:33.860
Please get well soon
and good luck with the election!

20:33.890 --> 20:36.590
We'll definitely vote for you!

20:38.900 --> 20:47.030
My Sovereign...the King who has
the power, wisdom and love...

20:48.640 --> 20:53.040
Reach for your fate
with your own hands.

20:55.350 --> 20:58.710
That's what it meant.

21:05.320 --> 21:08.290
Nancy, don't cry any more.

21:11.900 --> 21:16.100
I will make our dream come true.
Kelly's dream...

21:20.470 --> 21:21.800
Yes, Roger.

21:22.580 --> 21:27.410
I promise.
I will give you a little family.

21:28.010 --> 21:29.980
What?
Roger?

21:30.620 --> 21:34.450
A family with children,
little birds and a dog.

21:35.490 --> 21:36.550
Roger?

21:37.120 --> 21:40.110
I promise to come
home every night,...

21:40.460 --> 21:42.950
and all of us will gather
at the table for dinner.

21:45.430 --> 21:51.060
We will have a home
where everybody is happy.

21:57.610 --> 22:03.450
Nancy, you and I are going to
live in a happy little white house.
